@startuml
title getSenderAddress: learn the counterfactual address without deploying
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A78B5
  LifeLineBorderColor #4A78B5
}

participant "SDK / dApp" as D
participant "EntryPoint" as EP
participant "SenderCreator" as SC
participant "Factory" as F

D -> EP : eth_call getSenderAddress(initCode)
activate EP
EP -> SC : createSender(initCode)
activate SC
SC -> SC : require(msg.sender == entryPoint)
SC -> F : call factory(initCode[20:])
activate F
F --> SC : sender address\n(deployment happens in this frame)
deactivate F
SC --> EP : sender
deactivate SC
EP -->x D : revert SenderAddressResult(sender)
deactivate EP
note over D
  eth_call discards state, and the revert
  unwinds the factory deployment.
  Caller decodes sender from the error data.
end note
@enduml
